@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Welcome — GET /basics
GET {{baseUrl}}/basics

### Hello — GET /basics/hello
GET {{baseUrl}}/basics/hello

### Hello with name — GET /basics/hello/:name
GET {{baseUrl}}/basics/hello/Monte

### Greet with query params — GET /basics/greet?name=monte&language=en
GET {{baseUrl}}/basics/greet?name=monte&language=en

### List greetings — GET /basics/greetings
GET {{baseUrl}}/basics/greetings

### Create greeting — POST /basics/greetings
POST {{baseUrl}}/basics/greetings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 9,
  "name": "Bob",
  "message": "Hello, Bob!"
}

### Update greeting — PUT /basics/greetings/:id
PUT {{baseUrl}}/basics/greetings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hello again, Monte!"
}

### Delete greeting — DELETE /basics/greetings/:id
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/basics/greetings/9
